OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft says it is 'deeply
OL,4,Asorry' for global outage after almost
OL,5,A24 hours of disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FMicrosoft says it is deeply sorry for a
OL,8,Fglobal service outage that has
OL,9,Fdisrupted millions of users, saying it
OL,10,Fis "not related to cyber or AI/agents"
OL,11,Fand was introduced during an "earlier
OL,12,Fnetwork capacity upgrade"
OL,14,FIt says it is seeing "broad recovery
OL,15,Fand stability" across its services
OL,16,Fafter the outage which left Teams,
OL,17,FOutlook and AI software Copilot
OL,18,Finaccessible in at least 70 countries
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
