OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft says it is 'deeply
OL,4,Asorry' for global outage after almost
OL,5,A24 hours of disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier it warned of "intermittent
OL,8,Faccess issues" for some users - our
OL,9,Ftech reporter explains the glitches
OL,10,Fyour inbox may still be experiencing,
OL,11,Fmore than 20 hours after the issue
OL,12,Ffirst emerged
OL,14,FNHS England says the outage is
OL,15,F"inevitably" disrupting staff but
OL,16,Fappointments can continue; schools have
OL,17,Fbeen asking parents to get in touch via
OL,18,Fphone; US federal government and court
OL,19,Fsystems are also reporting issues
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
