OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft says it is 'deeply
OL,4,Asorry' for global outage after almost
OL,5,A24 hours of disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth African winemaker Peter Pentz
OL,8,Ftells us communication with exporters
OL,9,Fhas been brought "to a standstill".
OL,10,FMeanwhile, a group in London say they
OL,11,Fleft the office because if emails
OL,12,Fweren't working "it was time to go to
OL,13,Fthe pub"
